  9    /*====================================== start package constants used by otap ======================================*/
 10    -- we do not know the size of the setup configuration variable, this can be used as a string size attack, package will
 11    -- fail being created. otap can't handle this, must rely on Oracle (hard to believe). Nevertheless names currently
 12    -- (until Oracle 23i) are limited to 128 chars, if not using special UTF chars.
 13  
