213    /** FUNCTION otap_test.has_table
214    * Tests if a table exists or not and outputs the test result. Wrapper for otap_api.has_table.
215    * Writes and adds the test result for the current active test session.
216    *
217    * @param p_table_name The table name of the table, taken as is. If not case sensitive you must provide the table name in UPPERCASE.
218    * @param p_schema A schema override of the current test session if needed, taken as is. If given the table must exist in this schema. Case sensitive.
219    * @param p_description The test description if any. If not given, a description is generated, see FN template.
220    * @param p_expected_result The expected test result, 1 (Passed), -1 (FAILED), 0 (UNDEFINED). Default is 1 (Passed).
221    *
222    * @return The test result as text.
223    */
